      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Instead of make default-configuration having a rule about deleting stuff (applyconfiugratioN) – maybe have file dependency rule(s) – saying Configuraiton.mk file depends on DefaultCOnfiguraiton.xml file?",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "•\tTURN BUILD OF OPENSSL ON by default – and get windows working with build of openssl (some stuff doesn’t compile). Add to regitest s(maybe already there and verify our openssl cypt code does work on windoze too).",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "•\tUpdate configure scripts so we have:",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "o\tBuold TPP_OpenSSL",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "o\tUse Native_OpenSSL",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "o\tUse TPP_OpenSLL",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "o\tUse NO_OpenSSL",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "(same for other components like zlib, libcurl and xerces)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
         "type" : "doc",
         "version" : 1
      },
